==========================================================================

  Abstract:
    dist_l(I,I,Bool⊗Bool⊗Q) ; omap0(id, id_I ⊗ ctrl²(X)) ; undist_l

  Naive:
4 qubits, 15 gates
  X q[0]
  CX q[0, 1]
  CX q[0, 2]
  CRz q[0, 3]
  CX q[0, 1]
  CX q[0, 2]
  X q[0]
  CX q[0, 1]
  CCX q[0, 1, 2]
  QControlBox q[0, 1, 3]
  CCX q[0, 1, 2]
  CX q[0, 1]
  CCX q[0, 1, 2]
  CCX q[0, 1, 2]
  QControlBox q[0, 1, 2, 3]
  perm: [0, 1, 2, 3]
  Optimised:
4 qubits, 1 gates
  QControlBox q[0, 1, 2, 3]
  perm: [0, 1, 2, 3]

  Verification: ctrl³(X) = CCCX ?
    eq_circ: EQUAL (fidelity=1.000000)

==========================================================================
  LEVEL 4: ctrl⁴(X) — CCCCX  (5 qubits)
==========================================================================

  Abstract:
    dist_l(I,I,Bool⊗Bool⊗Bool⊗Q) ; omap0(id, id_I ⊗ ctrl³(X)) ; undist_l

  Naive:
5 qubits, 23 gates
  X q[0]
  CX q[0, 1]
  CX q[0, 2]
  CX q[0, 3]
  CRz q[0, 4]
  CX q[0, 1]
  CX q[0, 2]
  CX q[0, 3]
  X q[0]
  CX q[0, 1]
  CCX q[0, 1, 2]
  CCX q[0, 1, 3]
  QControlBox q[0, 1, 4]
  CCX q[0, 1, 2]
  CCX q[0, 1, 3]
  CX q[0, 1]
  CCX q[0, 1, 2]
  QControlBox q[0, 1, 2, 3]
  QControlBox q[0, 1, 2, 3]
  CCX q[0, 1, 2]
  QControlBox q[0, 1, 2, 3]
  QControlBox q[0, 1, 2, 3]
  CnX q[0, 1, 2, 3, 4]
  perm: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]
  Optimised:
5 qubits, 1 gates
  CnX q[0, 1, 2, 3, 4]
  perm: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]

  Verification: ctrl⁴(X) = CCCCX ?
    eq_circ: EQUAL (fidelity=1.000000)

==========================================================================
  SUMMARY
==========================================================================

  ctrl(f) = dist⁻¹ ∘ (id ⊕ (id ⊗ f)) ∘ dist

  Term          Qubits  Abstract                               Naive   Opt   
  ----          ------  --------                               -----   ---   
  ctrl(X)       2       dist ; (id ⊕ (id⊗X)) ; undist      4       1     
  ctrl²(X)     3       dist ; (id ⊕ (id⊗ctrl(X))) ; undist  9       1     
  ctrl³(X)     4       dist ; (id ⊕ (id⊗ctrl²(X))) ; undist  15      1     
  ctrl⁴(X)    5       dist ; (id ⊕ (id⊗ctrl³(X))) ; undist  23      1     

  Naive: anti-control X gates emitted even when left branch is identity.
  Opt:   compiler elides anti-control when branch body has 0 gates,
         leaving only the controlled right-branch gate (CnX).

  Verification (eq_circ against reference CnX, all fidelity 1.0):
    ctrl(X)  = CX     ctrl²(X) = CCX
    ctrl³(X) = CCCX   ctrl⁴(X) = CCCCX


